  "此格式另存需要选择本地目标路径": "Choose a local destination to save this format",
  "预览文件已另存，原文件未修改": "Preview file saved as a new file. Original file unchanged.",
  "Univer 多 Unit": "Univer multi-Unit",
  "当前为正在运行的 Univer 隔离草稿。先用精确 sessionId 调用 workbench_univer_office_status 获取全部 Unit，再用 workbench_univer_office_inspect 检查目标 Unit；不确定 Facade 能力时先调用 workbench_univer_office_api。若 editorSelection.kind 为 document，普通续写必须在其 startOffset 插入；存在选区时仅替换 startOffset 到 endOffset。不得默认追加到文末或重写整段。插入文本先去除首尾空白和空行，除用户明确要求排版、分段、列表或换页外，不得添加多余换行或空白段落。所有文档、表格、演示文稿的内容、格式、公式、表格、图表、图片、形状、页面布局与多 Unit 操作均通过 workbench_univer_office_execute_preview 调用完整 Univer Facade 直接写入隔离草稿；新增或删除 Unit 使用 workbench_univer_unit_preview；插入用户图片时先用 workbench_resource_library 找到唯一图片，再用 workbench_univer_office_insert_library_image。草稿可回退或放弃，只有用户保存后才写回原文件。": "This is an active isolated Univer draft. First call workbench_univer_office_status with the exact sessionId to list all Units, then workbench_univer_office_inspect for the target Unit. Consult workbench_univer_office_api when unsure about Facade capabilities. When editorSelection.kind is document, insert ordinary continuation text at startOffset; replace only startOffset through endOffset when a range is selected. Do not default to appending at the end or rewriting whole paragraphs. Trim leading/trailing whitespace and blank lines. Add line breaks only when required by the requested layout, paragraphs, lists or pagination. Use workbench_univer_office_execute_preview and the full Univer Facade for content, formatting, formulas, tables, charts, images, shapes, page layout and multi-Unit operations. Use workbench_univer_unit_preview to add or remove Units. Find an exact library image with workbench_resource_library before calling workbench_univer_office_insert_library_image. The draft can be undone or discarded; only saving writes to the original file.",
  "根据用户接下来输入的指令协助编辑当前资料；涉及写入时先生成确认预览。": "Help edit this material according to the user's next instructions. Prepare a confirmation preview before writing.",
  "请协助编辑资料库中的{0}文件“{1}”。当前文件 ID 是 {2}，编辑器草稿、光标位置与选中文字已作为工作台选区提供。我的编辑要求是：{3}。{4}": "Help edit the {0} file “{1}” in the library. Its file ID is {2}. The editor draft, cursor and selected text are available in the workspace selection. My edit request: {3}. {4}",
  "请在当前光标或选区位置协助续写、改写或排版": "Help continue, rewrite or format text at the current cursor or selection",
  "这是正在运行的 Univer 隔离草稿；普通文本只在 editorSelection 指定的光标位置插入或替换选区，先清理生成内容首尾空白，除版式确有需要外不增加换行或空白段落。先读取会话与目标 Unit，再使用工作台选区中的精确 sessionId 调用完整 Univer 编辑工具直接修改草稿；插入资料库图片时使用专用图片插入工具。草稿可回退或放弃，我会在完整编辑器里复核并决定保存。": "This is an active isolated Univer draft. Insert or replace ordinary text only at the cursor or range specified by editorSelection. Trim leading/trailing whitespace; add no extra line breaks or blank paragraphs unless the layout requires them. Read the session and target Unit first, then use the exact sessionId in the workspace selection with the full Univer editing tools to modify the draft directly. Use the dedicated tool for inserting library images. The draft can be undone or discarded. I will review it in the full editor and decide whether to save.",
  "需要写入文件时，先读取精确文件并生成确认预览，只有我确认后才能保存。": "Read the exact file and prepare a confirmation preview before writing. Save only after I confirm.",
